OL,3,GNEWSAHusband accused of GP murder
OL,4,Aappears at Crown Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing via video link from HMP
OL,7,FNorwich, he spoke only to confirm his
OL,8,Fname and that he understood proceedings
OL,9,Fat King's Lynn Crown Court. He was
OL,10,Fremanded in custody until a plea
OL,11,Fhearing on 3 December.
